{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S01、S07、S08：把离开后的孤单进一步转成对未来遇到难事时无人帮助、自己能否撑住的担忧，增加了一条偏向现实支持需求的线。\",\n    \"S09：将怀念旧日生活与归属感，改写成难受时是否有人陪伴，缩窄并改变了怀念的核心。\",\n    \"S11、S13：反复强调未来只能独自承担困难、还会孤单，使结尾的情绪重心部分转向对陪伴和支持的担忧，而非尊严与旧日归属之间的持续拉扯。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X始终让两股力量交织变化：他既怀念旧日生活和被接纳的亲近，又不愿为了找回它们重新忍受委屈，并逐渐学会带着怀念继续生活。Y虽然保留了尊严与怀念两面，但多次把主线转向未来遇到困难时是否有人依靠，使陪伴和现实支持成为了额外且逐渐突出的核心顾虑。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "05dedcea-f4f1-441d-80f7-c24121ab9096", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T075502497827Z", "elapsed_seconds": 10.813, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:55:13.330875+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3cf4edf99c6a0e35c599872e1157a0a8a8472f05d23512720b3bf0ce5324111c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedf